{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group-invoice-detail","type":"group","x":1350,"y":-400,"width":690,"height":980,"color":"1","label":"🔍 6. Invoice Detail & Actions Page (/invoices/[id])"},
		{"id":"group-invoice-create","type":"group","x":650,"y":-400,"width":650,"height":980,"color":"6","label":"📝 5. Create Invoice Page (/invoices/new)"},
		{"id":"group-products","type":"group","x":-720,"y":-40,"width":625,"height":780,"color":"4","label":"📦 3. Products Management Page (/products)"},
		{"id":"group-invoices-list","type":"group","x":0,"y":-70,"width":600,"height":780,"color":"2","label":"🧾 4. Invoices List Page (/invoices)"},
		{"id":"group-auth","type":"group","x":-1400,"y":-400,"width":540,"height":720,"color":"5","label":"🔐 1. Authentication Pages (/login & /register)"},
		{"id":"group-layout","type":"group","x":-650,"y":-400,"width":1250,"height":160,"color":"3","label":"🧭 2. Authenticated App Shell (Navbar & Header)"},
		{"id":"node-inv-detail-card","type":"text","text":"### 📄 Invoice View & Breakdown\n```text\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Invoice #INV-2026-0001              [ Status: ISSUED ]│\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Customer: Acme Distribution Corp                      │\n│  Issue Date: 02 Sep 2026       Due Date: 16 Sep 2026   │\n├───────────────────────┬──────────┬──────┬──────────────┤\n│  Product (Snapshot)   │ Unit Price│ Qty │ Line Total   │\n├───────────────────────┼──────────┼──────┼──────────────┤\n│  Steel Widget         │ Rp 50.000│   10 │   Rp 500.000 │\n│  Brass Gadget         │ Rp 75.000│    4 │   Rp 300.000 │\n├───────────────────────┴──────────┴──────┴──────────────┤\n│  Subtotal:                                  Rp 800.000 │\n│  Tax Amount (11%):                          Rp  88.000 │\n│  Total Due:                                 Rp 888.000 │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```","x":1390,"y":-340,"width":610,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-inv-detail-actions","type":"text","text":"### ⚡ Contextual Lifecycle Action Controls\n```text\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Available Actions for this Invoice:                   │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  IF STATUS == 'DRAFT':                                 │\n│  [ ✏️ Edit Line Items ]  [ 🚀 Issue Invoice ]  [ ❌ Cancel]│\n│                                                        │\n│  IF STATUS == 'ISSUED':                                │\n│  [ 💵 Mark as Paid ]       [ ⚠️ Cancel & Restore Stock ]│\n│                                                        │\n│  IF STATUS == 'PAID' or 'CANCELLED':                   │\n│  [ 🔒 Invoice is finalized in terminal state ]         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n- Issue: Atomic decrement with error guard if stock depleted\n- Cancel: Restores inventory items atomically","x":1390,"y":70,"width":610,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-app-header","type":"text","text":"```text\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  📦 StockFlow       [📦 Products]      [🧾 Invoices]                      👤 demo@stockflow.dev   [Logout] │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n- Global session guard: Redirects to `/login` if unauthenticated\n- Active tab highlighting (`/products` vs `/invoices`)\n- Displays logged-in user email with quick logout trigger","x":-610,"y":-350,"width":1170,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-inv-create-header","type":"text","text":"### 👤 1. Customer & Invoice Info\n```text\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  <- Back to Invoices              New Invoice Draft    │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Customer Name *                                       │\n│  [ PT Maju Mundur Sukses                            ]  │\n│                                                        │\n│  Issue Date                  Due Date                  │\n│  [ 2026-09-02          ]     [ 2026-09-16          ]   │\n│                                                        │\n│  Notes (Optional)                                      │\n│  [ Payment terms 14 days...                         ]  │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```","x":690,"y":-340,"width":570,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-inv-create-items","type":"text","text":"### 🛒 2. Dynamic Line Items Builder\n```text\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Line Items                                            │\n├───────────────────────┬──────────┬──────┬───────┬──────┤\n│  Select Product       │ Price    │ Qty  │ Total │      │\n├───────────────────────┼──────────┼──────┼───────┼──────┤\n│ [Steel Widget (120)]  │ Rp 50.000│ [ 5] │250.000│ [🗑️] │\n│ [Brass Gadget (45) ]  │ Rp 75.000│ [ 2] │150.000│ [🗑️] │\n├───────────────────────┴──────────┴──────┴───────┴──────┤\n│  [ + Add Another Product Line ]                        │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n- Live dropdown showing available `quantityOnHand`\n- Stock limit validation guard (cannot order > available stock)\n- Snapshots `unitPrice` and `productName` on entry","x":690,"y":-100,"width":570,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-inv-create-totals","type":"text","text":"### 💰 3. Live Totals & Submission\n```text\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Subtotal:                               Rp 400.000    │\n│  Tax (11% PPN):                           Rp  44.000    │\n│  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────   │\n│  Grand Total:                            Rp 444.000    │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  [ Cancel ]          [ Save as Draft ]   [ Save & Issue]│\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n- Client computes live preview for instant user feedback\n- Server recalculates all financial totals authoritatively\n- 'Save & Issue' runs single atomic transaction to lock stock","x":690,"y":190,"width":570,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-auth-login","type":"text","text":"### 📱 Sign In (`/login`)\n```text\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  📦 StockFlow                             │\n│  Sign in to your account                  │\n├───────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  [⚠️ Error Banner: Invalid credentials]    │\n│                                           │\n│  Email Address                            │\n│  [ user@example.com                    ]  │\n│                                           │\n│  Password                                 │\n│  [ ••••••••••••                        ]  │\n│                                           │\n│  [            Sign In Button            ] │\n├───────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Don't have an account? Create one ->     │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```","x":-1360,"y":-340,"width":460,"height":310,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-auth-register","type":"text","text":"### 📱 Register (`/register`)\n```text\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  📦 StockFlow                             │\n│  Create a new workspace                   │\n├───────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Full Name (Optional)                     │\n│  [ John Doe                            ]  │\n│                                           │\n│  Email Address                            │\n│  [ user@example.com                    ]  │\n│                                           │\n│  Password (min. 8 characters)             │\n│  [ ••••••••••••                        ]  │\n│                                           │\n│  [           Create Account             ] │\n├───────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Already have an account? Sign in ->      │\n└───────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```","x":-1360,"y":-10,"width":460,"height":310,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-prod-list","type":"text","text":"### 📦 Product Catalog Table\n```text\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Products Inventory                 [ + Add Product ]  │\n│  [ 🔍 Search by Name or SKU...       ]                 │\n├──────────┬──────────────────┬───────────┬─────┬────────┤\n│ SKU      │ Name             │ Price     │ Qty │ Action │\n├──────────┼──────────────────┼───────────┼─────┼────────┤\n│ WID-001  │ Steel Widget     │ Rp 50.000 │ 120 │ ✏️ 🗑️  │\n│ GAD-002  │ Brass Gadget     │ Rp 75.000 │  45 │ ✏️ 🗑️  │\n│ BOL-003  │ Titanium Bolt    │ Rp 15.000 │   0 │ ✏️ 🗑️  │\n├──────────┴──────────────────┴───────────┴─────┴────────┤\n│  Showing 1-10 of 24 products       [< Prev] [1] [Next >│\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n- Real-time debounced search by name/SKU\n- Server-side pagination (`page`, `limit`)\n- Delete protected: Blocked if referenced in invoice","x":-680,"y":20,"width":560,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-prod-modal","type":"text","text":"### ✏️ Add / Edit Product Modal\n```text\n┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Add New Product                      [X] │\n├───────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  SKU (Unique)                             │\n│  [ WID-004                             ]  │\n│  Product Name                             │\n│  [ Stainless Steel Valve               ]  │\n│  Unit Price (Rupiah / Cents)              │\n│  [ Rp 85.000                           ]  │\n│  Quantity on Hand                         │\n│  [ 50                                  ]  │\n│                                           │\n│  [ Cancel ]               [ Save Product ]│\n└───────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```","x":-680,"y":430,"width":520,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-inv-status-flow","type":"text","text":"### 🔄 Invoice State Machine Visual\n```text\n       ┌──────────────┐\n       │    DRAFT     │───(Cancel)───► [ CANCELLED ] (No Stock Change)\n       └──────┬───────┘\n              │ (Issue Invoice - Decrements Stock Atomically)\n              ▼\n       ┌──────────────┐\n       │    ISSUED    │───(Cancel)───► [ CANCELLED ] (Restores Stock Atomically)\n       └──────┬───────┘\n              │ (Mark Paid)\n              ▼\n       ┌──────────────┐\n       │     PAID     │ (Terminal State)\n       └──────────────┘\n```","x":40,"y":400,"width":520,"height":280,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-inv-list","type":"text","text":"### 🧾 Invoice Ledger Table\n```text\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Invoices List                    [ + Create Invoice ] │\n│  Tabs: [ ALL ] [ DRAFT ] [ ISSUED ] [ PAID ] [CANCEL]  │\n├──────────────┬──────────────┬──────────┬────────┬──────┤\n│ Invoice #    │ Customer     │ Total    │ Status │ View │\n├──────────────┼──────────────┼──────────┼────────┼──────┤\n│ INV-2026-001 │ Acme Corp    │ Rp 1.11M │ ISSUED │  👁️  │\n│ INV-2026-002 │ Wayne Tech   │ Rp 555K  │ DRAFT  │  👁️  │\n│ INV-2026-003 │ Stark Ind    │ Rp 2.22M │ PAID   │  👁️  │\n│ INV-2026-004 │ Cyberdyne    │ Rp 100K  │ CANCEL │  👁️  │\n├──────────────┴──────────────┴──────────┴────────┴──────┤\n│  Showing 1-10 of 18 invoices       [< Prev] [1] [Next >│\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n- Filter tab by status (`DRAFT`, `ISSUED`, `PAID`, `CANCELLED`)\n- Distinct status badge colors for instant recognition","x":40,"y":-10,"width":560,"height":380,"color":"2"}
	],
